NOT A MEDICAL DEVICE

This notice is not a licence term. It is here because the licence above
permits any use, and some uses of this particular software would be unsafe.

RotaGuide is a student engineering prototype produced for a university
course. It has not been evaluated or approved by Health Canada, the FDA, or
any other regulator. It has not undergone clinical validation. Four of its
nine technical specifications were verified under simulated conditions with
five participants; the remaining five, including ISO 10993 material
biocompatibility, were never tested.

It does not provide medical advice and must not be used to make decisions
about insulin therapy. If you are considering deploying this, or anything
derived from it, in a setting where real patients rely on it, that is a
regulated medical device and it needs to be developed and licensed as one.
